      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .faq-section {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    width: 100%;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 16px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .faq-title {\n    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 32px;\n  }\n  .faq-item {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n  }\n  .faq-item:first-child {\n    border-top: 1px solid #e5e5e5;\n  }\n  .faq-question {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    padding: 18px 16px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    background: #fff;\n    transition: background 0.2s ease;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-question {\n    background: #f7f7f7;\n  }\n  .faq-icon {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 22px;\n  }\n  .faq-icon svg {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: block;\n  }\n  .faq-question-text {\n    flex: 1;\n    font-size: clamp(15px, 2vw, 17px);\n    color: #2b2fa3;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-question-text {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  .faq-chevron {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-chevron {\n    transform: rotate(180deg);\n  }\n  .faq-answer {\n    max-height: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    transition: max-height 0.3s ease;\n    padding: 0 16px 0 52px;\n  }\n  .faq-item.active .faq-answer {\n    max-height: 300px;\n    padding-bottom: 18px;\n  }\n  .faq-answer p {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: clamp(14px, 1.8vw, 16px);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #444;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 500px) {\n    .faq-answer {\n      padding-left: 40px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"faq-section\">\n  <div class=\"faq-title\">Frequently Asked Questions</div>\n\n  <div class=\"faq-list\">\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">How long until I see results?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Many customers notice their skin feels calmer and more hydrated after the first application. For visible improvements in redness, dullness, and skin texture, we recommend consistent daily use for at least 30 days to allow your skin cycle to adjust.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Is this safe to use?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Yes. 345 Relief Cream is clinically tested as non-comedogenic and formulated with Centella Asiatica and Ceramide NP to soothe and support the skin's natural barrier. It's gentle enough for daily use, including on sensitive or acne-prone skin. We always recommend a patch test before full use.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Where can I use 345 Relief Cream?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Apply to the face as the final or semi-final step in your routine, after cleansing and lighter products like toner. It's designed to target blemish-prone and irritated areas while nourishing the surrounding skin.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Does it have a scent?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>The cream is formulated without added synthetic fragrances. It's nearly odorless, with only a faint, natural scent from the botanical ingredients that fades quickly after application.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Do I need other products with this cream?</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"faq-answer\">\n        <p>Not necessarily. This cream works well on its own as a daily moisturizer for post-acne and sensitive skin, but it's also lightweight enough to layer over serums like niacinamide or centella if you follow a multi-step routine.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-item\">\n      <div class=\"faq-question\" data-link=\"https://doctoraltheaglobal.com/account/login\">\n        <span class=\"faq-icon\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9.5 9a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0c0 1.5-2.5 2-2.5 3.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"17\" r=\"0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg>\n        </span>\n        <span class=\"faq-question-text\">Manage your subscription</span>\n        <span class=\"faq-chevron\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M6 9l6 6 6-6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function() {\n  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(q => {\n    q.addEventListener('click', function() {\n      const link = this.getAttribute('data-link');\n      if (link) {\n        window.location.href = link;\n        return;\n      }\n      const item = this.parentElement;\n      const wasActive = item.classList.contains('active');\n      document.querySelectorAll('.faq-item').forEach(i => i.classList.remove('active'));\n      if (!wasActive) item.classList.add('active');\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>",
